  "name": "Vendor Registration",
  "description": "Register new suppliers: company and legal details, tax ID, products supplied, contacts, certificates and insurance documents.",
  "category": "Business",
  "seoTitle": "Free Vendor Registration Form Template",
  "seoDescription": "Vendor registration form template for supplier onboarding: legal entity, tax ID, contacts, product categories, W-9, insurance certificate and code of conduct.",
